  "description": "Janet Carroll Estate Agents are delighted to bring Apt 26 Woodview Court to the market.\n\nThis is a very fine 1st floor 2 bed apartment of approx. 70 ms / 753 sq.ft, which is dual aspect and is beautifully presented throughout. \n\nWoodview Court is a highly regarded development of just 30 apartments, offering a rare combination of privacy, tranquillity and community. With most residences owner-occupied, it has a welcoming, well-established atmosphere that is increasingly difficult to find in such a convenient suburban setting.\n\nThis is an ideal property for those going to college, especially UCD being on the QBC with easy access to Belfield Campus as well as being only a 15 minute cycle away from it.\n\nSituated in the heart of Stillorgan village, the apartment is within easy walking distance of an excellent range of everyday amenities, including shops, cafés, restaurants, pubs, a Flyefit gym, several supermarkets. Woodview is close to several primary and secondary schools. The new Stillorgan Library, currently under construction, will add another valuable community resource to this already well-served neighbourhood. \n\nThe rear entrance to Glenalbyn Sports Club is only moments away, home to Kilmacud Crokes, Glenalbyn Tennis Club and the popular Village Café. Excellent transport links further enhance the appeal of this location. Frequent bus services along the Quality Bus Corridor provide swift access to UCD, Dublin city centre and surrounding business districts, while additional routes connect Stillorgan with Dún Laoghaire, Dundrum and Bray. Safe pedestrian crossings nearby make commuting both simple and convenient.\n\nWhether you're taking your first step onto the property ladder, looking to downsize without compromising on convenience, or seeking a quality investment in one of South Dublin's most established neighbourhoods, this apartment represents an exceptional opportunity. Combining a peaceful setting with outstanding local amenities, excellent transport connections and a strong sense of community, Woodview Court is a place you'll be proud to call home.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n \nEntrance Hall: c. 3.29m x 1.78m\n\nL- Shaped. Fitted press with sliding doors. Shelved Hot Press with timer.\n\nLiving Room: c. 4.30m x 3.29m\n\nLarge picture overlooking lovely, glorious communal gardens. Archway to:\n\nKitchen/ Dining Area:  c. 5.07m x 3.11m\n\nKitchen Area:\n\nRange of fitted cupboards and presses. Stainless steel sink unit. Formica worktops and tiled splashbacks. Zanussi double oven and hob. Blanco extractor fan. Beko washing machine. Zanussi Fridge freezer. Zanussi dishwasher. Tiled floor.\n \nDining Area:  \n\nLarge picture window overlooking glorious communal gardens.\n\nMain Bedroom: c. 3.88m x 3.29m\n\nMirrored slide robes. Picture window overlooking front.\n\nBedroom 2: c. 4.30m x 3.11m\n\nMirrored slide robes. Sliding door to balcony overlooking front.\n\nBathroom: c. 2.32m x 1.66m\n\nStand in shower with Rain head shower. Feature shelf, fully tiled. W.C., wash hand basin with fitted cupboards in matching suite. 2 fitted wall presses. Tiled floor. Part tiled walls.\n\nBalcony: c. 3.11m x 1.00m\n\nBER DETAILS\n \nBER: C\nBER No: 119494870\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 131.83 kWh/m²/yr\n\nMANAGEMENT COMPANY:\n\nKPM management company.\n\nService Charge: \n\nApprox. €2758 per annum\n\nOUTSIDE\nThere is a large  very well-maintained communal garden with an abundance for flowering shrubs and flowerbed borders.\nThere is one designated car parking space and some visitor car parking spaces.\n\nDIRECTIONS\n \nGoogle search Eircode A94 KX06 from your current location.\n\nVIEWING\n                        \nBy appointment with Andrew Quirke 086 383 4703, email andrew@janetcarroll.ie or (01) 288 2020 \n \nOFFERS\n \nOffer is to be sent by email to andrew@janetcarroll.ie\n \nIMPORTANT NOTICE\n \nJanet Carroll Estate Agents for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of this property whose agents they are, give